   410	back to another target, another driver, `go-v1`, a script, a system command, or
   411	a generic build facility.
   412	
   413	The command and descriptor drivers MUST be equal, and both MUST name the same
   414	external identifier. The whole repository snapshot remains the validation,
   415	identity, and audit subject; only the selected build root is compiler-visible;
