   420	### 6. Toolchain boundary
   421	
   422	The manifest toolchain requirement, trusted resolution, version grammar and
   423	comparison, two-stage preflight ordering, diagnostics, and installation-guidance
   424	catalog are defined by the shared toolchain contract, decision 0007
   425	(`TASK-260728-1g0z69`), and integrated by `TASK-260728-2jaw7h`. This decision
   426	does not restate or redefine them. It supplies the two things that contract
   427	leaves to this one — the version numbers of the schemas that carry it, fixed in
   428	section 1, and the exact wire slots it lands in, fixed in sections 4 and 5 —
