   452	   toolchains never alias in the cache, the receipt, the marker, or a claim.
   453	5. Host availability and version preflight runs before source acquisition, and
   454	   the project-metadata compatibility cross-check runs after local validation or
   455	   exact external acquisition and audit and before any compiler work. This
   456	   ordering is owned by the toolchain contract and is restated here only because
   457	   the artifact and audit boundary assumes it.
