   461	Decision 0006 defines `manager-worker-v1` with a Go-bound process graph —
   462	`<GOROOT>/bin/go` and executables below
   463	`<GOROOT>/pkg/tool/<GOHOSTOS>_<GOHOSTARCH>/` — and a Go-bound session of exactly
   464	one `go list` and exactly one `go build`. Its own rejected-alternatives list
