   472	This boundary therefore mints a second portable execution-policy identity,
   473	`manager-worker-v2`, and leaves `manager-worker-v1` untouched.
   474	
   475	**`manager-worker-v1` is frozen and Go-only.** Its definition, process graph,
   476	session shape, and wording in decision 0006, `protocol/core.md` section 4.2.1,
   477	and `profiles/manager.md` section 2.2.1 keep their exact meaning and exact
