   532	session admits no retry, second graph phase, second compile phase, additional
   533	executable, shell, VCS operation, dependency download, generator, test, run, or
   534	tool request. A driver that cannot map its pipeline onto that session shape MUST
   535	NOT be admitted in this version; widening the session shape further requires yet
   536	another execution-policy identity, a new claim schema version, and its own
