   538	
   539	Because both identities are closed constants inside the canonical build input, a
   540	v1 entry and a v2 entry can never alias in the cache, a receipt, a marker, or a
   541	claim, and a reader that knows only v1 cannot mistake a v2 artifact for a
   542	portable Go artifact.
   543	
   544	The per-operation host capability evidence record is re-versioned to
