   358	phase keeps its existing position and its existing predecessor set.
   359	
   360	For `go` this costs nothing. Stage A reuses the three package-independent
   361	bootstrap probes that section 4.2 already runs from the manager parent —
   362	`go telemetry off`, `go version`, `go env -json ...` — so the five Go
