   555	  assertion by consulting the named distribution — reopening the selection path.
   556	  The suffix names where a toolchain comes from, which is exactly what
   557	  `forbidden` is reserved for.
   558	- **Reject `toolchain default` as unclassifiable.** Rejected: it is the one
